# Healthcare Data Engineering — Project Documentation

## 1. Project Title

**Healthcare OLTP to OLAP Data Engineering using MySQL, PySpark and Databricks**

---

## 2. Problem Statement

Healthcare organizations generate large amounts of transactional data related to patients, doctors, appointments, diagnoses, treatments, medications, laboratory tests, insurance, billing, and payments.

This project implements a data engineering pipeline that transforms normalized healthcare OLTP data into an analytical OLAP Star Schema.

The pipeline performs:

- Data ingestion
- Data cleansing
- Data validation
- Data transformation
- Star Schema modeling
- Slowly Changing Dimensions
- Incremental / CDC-style processing
- Data-quality validation
- Healthcare analytics

---

## 3. Project Objective

The main objective is to build an end-to-end healthcare data engineering pipeline that converts transactional healthcare data into clean, reliable, historical, and analytics-ready data.

The final system supports analysis of:

- Patient visits
- Doctor performance
- Department performance
- Treatment outcomes
- Disease trends
- Medication usage
- Laboratory tests
- Hospital revenue
- Billing trends
- Insurance claims
- Healthcare KPIs

